description:
Permanently deletes one reading insight the reader saved in ReadingRate, with the conversation record attached to it. It cannot be undone. A copy the reader's Notion already received stays in their Notion, and the result says so.

Use when the reader asks to delete or forget an insight they saved. Find its id with get_reading_notes, and confirm with the reader which insight they mean before deleting.

Example: {"insight_id": "<insight id>"}
